[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4950109864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121247#issuecomment-4950109864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121247","id":4950109864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJwyuqA","user":{"login":"mrcdk","id":483531,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MzUzMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/483531?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk","html_url":"https://github.com/mrcdk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-12T05:37:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T05:37:44Z","body":"This is the correct behavior. [`Tween.set_parallel()`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_tween.html#class-tween-method-set-parallel) makes all the [`Tweeners`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_tweener.html#class-tweener) appended after it to run in parallel. [`CallbackTweener`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_callbacktweener.html#class-callbacktweener) is a `Tweener`. [`Tween.parallel()`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_tween.html#class-tween-method-parallel) makes only that `Tweener` to run in parallel while all the others will run sequentially.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4950109864/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4950116780","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121247#issuecomment-4950116780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121247","id":4950116780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJwzJrA","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-12T05:40:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T05:41:21Z","body":"You can keep using `SetParallel()` and use `tween.Chain().TweenCallback()` instead to get the desired behaviour as well. That makes the 'default' for a new Tweener that it runs in parallel, but make the given Tweener run after all the previous (parallel) Tweeners have ended.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4950116780/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0